    "_srcBlendFactor": 770,
    "_dstBlendFactor": 771,
    "_string": "+ By default, 6 cards will be drawn at the beginning of each round. Player and Banker, each hand will start with 2 cards face down. \n+ The third card will be dealt according to the total points of the first 2 cards on each hand. \n+ The game determines the win or loss by comparing the total points of all cards on each hand and the winning hand is the one closest to a total of 9 points. ",
